{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2694\ufe0f <strong>ABOUT THIS GAME</strong> \ud83d\udd78\ufe0f Step into the shadows of a crumbling realm where a lone <strong>Dark Knight</strong> rises from the depths of despair to face the horrors that dwell beneath. In this grim dungeon-crawling action RPG, you take control of a cursed warrior whose only path to redemption lies through blood, steel, and arcane fire.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf11 <strong>Features</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dark Fantasy Combat</strong>: Fight grotesque enemies using devastating melee combos, dark magic, and tactical dodges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive Dungeon Exploration</strong>: Traverse haunted catacombs, ancient crypts, and mysterious chambers. Each room holds secrets\u2026 or death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrade &amp; Evolve</strong>: Unlock powerful skills, collect enchanted gear, and forge legendary weapons to survive deeper into the abyss.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Portal Progression System</strong>: Clear zones and activate mystical portals to return, recover, and venture further into darkness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Retro-Inspired Visuals</strong>: Pixel art meets gothic horror, blending nostalgia with atmospheric dread.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3898620?t=1754357836","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3898620?t=1754357836","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898620/70a71a7e235c1d6705be812e0821d5006c2da122/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754357836","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898620/70a71a7e235c1d6705be812e0821d5006c2da122/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754357836","categories":[{"description":